OL,3,GNEWSANepal floods unite Maidstone as
OL,4,A'single community'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA vigil has been held in Maidstone for
OL,7,Feveryone affected by the flash floods
OL,8,Fin Nepal that have now claimed 1,311
OL,9,Flives.
OL,11,FThirty three people from the UK are
OL,12,Famong 5,330 still missing after
OL,13,Fdevastating landslides and flash floods
OL,14,Fhit the Nepal-Tibet border on 26
OL,15,FAugust.
OL,17,FFriday night's candlelight service in
OL,18,FJubilee Square, organised by Maidstone
OL,19,FBorough Council (MBC), follows a
OL,20,Fseparate vigil held in Dartford on
OL,21,FThursday.
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,322,320,200,140,0,100
