OL,3,GNEWSANepal floods unite Maidstone as
OL,4,A'single community'
OL,5,
OL,6,FMajor Ekbahadur Gurung, chair of the
OL,7,FMaidstone Gurkha Nepalese Community,
OL,8,Fsaid "we come together as a single
OL,9,Fcommunity when there is a tragedy like
OL,10,Fthis".
